[00:03.57]Maybe it's the midnight air.
[00:03.57]也许是夜色朦胧
[00:07.82]Something about the summer night.
[00:07.82]关于夏天夜里的思绪涌入心头
[00:12.09]Maybe it's the stars up there.
[00:12.09]可能是星落云散
[00:16.46]That made me say what is on my mind.
[00:16.46]使我诉说出了心事
[00:20.86]I love the way you twist your hair.
[00:20.86]我爱你扭头发的方式
[00:24.95]I am seeing how you roll your eyes.
[00:24.95]我看你如何翻白眼
[00:29.46]I am watching how your cheeks turn red.
[00:29.46]我盯着你的脸颊如何一点点变红
[00:33.70]Must mean I am doing something right.
[00:33.70]那意味着我做对了什么呢
[00:38.48]I ant just blowing smoke.
[00:38.48]我当然不是在空谈快意
[00:41.63]Girl, tonight, you look so beautiful.
[00:41.63]女孩今晚你看起来美丽极了
[00:45.79].This must be a blessing, I just had to take a second
[00:45.79]这是赞美我只是需要一点时间
[00:50.27]Step aside and catch my-And let you know.
[00:50.27]我会主动离去，请抓住我-我会让你知道
[00:54.82]Promise, girl I ant just blowing smoke.
[00:54.82]我保证，女孩，这不是空谈快意
[00:58.98]let's go somewhere where we can be alone.
[00:58.98]我们可不可以去一个只有我们的地方
[01:03.17]Roll one up and burn it extra slow until the morning.
[01:03.17]积累然后燃烧一直到早上
[01:07.80]Feeling like I had to come and let you know.
[01:07.80]我会让你慢慢地感受
[01:12.43]Maybe you were heaven-sent yeah.
[01:12.43]也许你是上天赐予我的
[01:17.41]Or maybe it's a waste of time.
[01:17.41]或者这是在浪费时间
[01:22.02]But I am willing to take that bet.
[01:22.02]但是我愿意为你赌一把
[01:26.21]So, darling, will you roll the dice?
[01:26.21]所以亲爱的，你愿意来当那个投骰子的人吗?
